    side_effects_en = "Flushing, headache, jaw pain, nausea, diarrhea, leg pain, hypotension, increased bleeding tendency",
    cautions_en = "Limited long-term outcome evidence in Western guidelines compared to ERA/PDE5i/selexipag, though commonly used in Asian practice when access to other agents is restricted · Contraindicated in active bleeding."
